  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Private Sector Projects Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund has been set up to enable us to test innovative approaches to private sector engagement for development. Through this fund we will collaborate and/or partner with private sector organisations in New&#xA0;Zealand and the Pacific to enhance trade, enable import substitution, and catalyse innovations in business that will have significant impacts on economic development in the Pacific.</narrative>
  </description>
